nits.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gated code directives and shared fenced-code contract[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]launch-code-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch-code-contract: create the typed_launch_units beta gate and one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust-owned CodeValue, directive grammar, fence scanner, and code-input [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire shared by runtime and editor surfaces.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Typed mixed-unit planning and wait graph[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]typed-launch-graph[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launch-code-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed-launch-graph: replace agent-shaped fanout planning with a pure, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-versioned Agent-or-Proc launch graph whose waits, conditions, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identifiers, validation, and preview are fixed before approval.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable launch admission coordinator[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]durable-launch-admission[dim] · [dim][/dim]after typed-launch-graph[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]durable-launch-admission: persist and supervise approved launch-unit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]outcomes, resolving waits before conditions and resources while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserving the existing agent launch path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sandboxed conditional admission runtime[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]conditional-runtime[dim] · [dim][/dim]after durable-launch-admission[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]conditional-runtime: eval